<h2>Workflow Tips</h2>

<p>
    Additional tips for efficient workflows:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Use search first</strong> – Before clicking through menus, try searching—it's often faster</li>
    <li><strong>Keep help handy</strong> – Pin help for new features, then unpin once you're comfortable</li>
    <li><strong>Learn shortcuts gradually</strong> – Pick one or two shortcuts to learn at a time</li>
    <li><strong>Customize your workspace</strong> – Arrange panels and views to match your workflow</li>
    <li><strong>Use voice when helpful</strong> – Don't forget about voice commands for hands-free operation</li>
</ul>

