<h2>Getting the Most from Help</h2>

<p>
    Make the help system work for you:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Search help content</strong> – Use search to find specific topics quickly</li>
    <li><strong>Bookmark important pages</strong> – Keep frequently referenced help pages accessible</li>
    <li><strong>Follow cross-references</strong> – Click links between help pages to learn related topics</li>
    <li><strong>Use examples</strong> – Help pages include examples—use them as starting points</li>
</ul>

